<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>I Love Hollywood!</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Slayyyter</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">STARFUCKER (Deluxe)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">5Uwt8htBxnz0pUjUlZg6Tj</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.230" end="00:16.050">Ow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.050" end="00:18.000">First he love me, then he don't</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.000" end="00:20.020">Fuck the 90210</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.020" end="00:22.040">Get into this bag of coke</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.040" end="00:23.700">Brand new Prada means I'm broke</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.700" end="00:25.840">Legs, sex, party, drugs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.840" end="00:27.920">Smilin' isn't glamorous</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.920" end="00:29.870">Don't bring Cathy, she's a cunt</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.870" end="00:31.810">That bitch would embarrass us</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.810" end="00:33.730">Oh, thank God I sold my soul</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.730" end="00:35.720">Glitter, smoke and rock and roll</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.720" end="00:37.830">K-Hole when I lose control</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.830" end="00:39.910">Dancin' on a stripper pole</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.910" end="00:42.040">I wanna die at the Chateau</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.040" end="00:43.980">I'm gonna take you tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.980" end="00:48.100">No cigarettes in my hotel, unless you're being polite</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.100" end="00:53.580" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha, oh my God, you're not even on the list)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.580" end="00:55.280" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Girl, I am the list)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.280" end="01:02.750">I love Hollywood! (Uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.750" end="01:08.240">I love Hollywood! (Uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.240" end="01:11.090" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ah-ah-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.090" end="01:16.770">I love Hollywood! (Oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.770" end="01:18.840" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.840" end="01:23.910">I love Hollywood! (Uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.910" end="01:27.390" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ah-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.390" end="01:29.250">Sequin dress and dirty lies</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.250" end="01:31.220">Dinner's just a sacrifice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.220" end="01:33.120">Terry Richardson just called me up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.120" end="01:35.140">That freak is takin' my pic tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.140" end="01:37.380">Latex, car lights</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.380" end="01:39.140">Hollywood is paradise</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.140" end="01:41.080">Sunset Tower, treat me nice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.080" end="01:43.140">Brand new face by Dr. Weiss</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.140" end="01:45.140">Party but I never sleep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.140" end="01:47.090">I look so heroin chic</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.090" end="01:49.090">It's not fashionable to eat</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.090" end="01:51.350">Kissin' strangers on the street</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.350" end="01:53.240">I wanna die at the Chateau</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.240" end="01:55.310">I'm gonna take you tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.310" end="01:59.730">No cigarettes in my hotel, unless you're being polite</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.730" end="02:01.860" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(And I've never done a drug)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.860" end="02:04.350" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I've never done drugs in my life)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.350" end="02:07.650" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(You're doin' coke right now)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.650" end="02:15.300">I love Hollywood! (Uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.300" end="02:19.960">I love Hollywood! (Uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.960" end="02:23.500" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ah-ah-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.500" end="02:31.190">I love Hollywood! (Oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.190" end="02:35.260">I love Hollywood! (Uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.260" end="02:36.760" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ah-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.220" end="02:40.220" /></div></body></tt>